e ensuite and WIC, plus 3 spacious bedrooms & 2 bathrooms. Downstairs is rec room w/bar, living room w/2 additional bedrooms plus separate 1 bed/1 bath suite. Double garage with Tesla EV charger.  Close to shopping, dining, recreation. Golf course nearby. Easy access to Hwy 1. Great schools. (id:67604)"},"30527073":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R3184916_18.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306250768500000/reb89/highres/6/R318491